2026-07-27T08:44:09.2595923Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2646698Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2647439Z i /tmp/RtmpFNSMSu/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2647696Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2647994Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2648379Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2648764Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2649555Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2649967Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2837667Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:09.2917404Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:09.3258997Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:44:09.3385028Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
